    "title": "AKU faculty awarded Sitara-i-Imtiaz",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The president of Pakistan has honoured AKU's Dr Nehal Masood with the prestigious award.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "ac1c7e6b3e2a5e68",
        "component": "news_media",
